 "_setC_continuity": {
  "a_chairs": "r3_kitchen and p3_soup_2601 show only 3 chairs: the table’s right side stands against the wall. The fourth chair of the ep8 epilogue (§0.1 #25, §8.4) has to be ADDED on the near side by that edit.",
  "b_seah_door_hinge": "Seah’s door is hinged on the LEFT as seen from the living room (r3_door) and on the LEFT as seen from inside (r3_sr_bed) — the two views are mirrored. Later edits keep each view as it is.",
  "c_front_door_hinge": "p3_kongi_1130 shows the front door hinged on the RIGHT; r3_door, c3_lockpanel and p3_kongi_1213 put the lever on the right (= hinges on the left). The ep8 open-door edit follows r3_door.",
  "d_seah_room_plan": "Views A (r3_sr_desk) and B (r3_sr_bed) do not share one floor plan (B has the desk at lower right and a second white bookshelf at left). Ep10 should not try to make A and B agree.",
  "rule": "captions and hotspots never state a left/right relationship between these views."
 }
